academy-id "q-84980" :question/is-example false :question/problem "How many made-up $3$-letter words can be made using only $5$ vowels, where each vowel cannot appear in the word more than once?" :question/worked-solution "The number of permutations of $n$ objects taken $r$ at a time is given by the formula\n\n$$\n{}_{n}{P}_{r}=\\frac{n!}{(n-r)!}.\n$$\n\nThere are $5$ vowels, so $n=5.$ We want to select $3$ of those vowels to make-up a $3$-letter word, so we have $r=3.$ \n\nTherefore, the number of different made-up words is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{}_{5}{P}_{3} & =\\frac{5!}{(5-3)!} \\\\  & =\\frac{5!}{2!} \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\cdot 4\\cdot 3\\cdot \\cancel{2!}}{\\cancel{2!}} \\\\  & =5\\cdot 4\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =60.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-84980/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "060e80f0-44bd-5378-9253-999548115dd9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-84980"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-84987/selection/c018785cafcbb9b0ca150229bce2a2270e18f700703feeb95e7870780df8ba76" :answer/id #uuid "4a2ae9dd-b223-5fb2-8c0e-62da77ed80d8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "143\\,640" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-84987/selection/3f8ee34d110d139f8e4c05d7fb17590d28df3f918486651176815dde911f272d" :answer/id #uuid "e4f14495-f832-59b1-8aeb-2ef8046ca381" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "92\\,845" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-84987/selection/470cdc92dc03ec9001e97fdd7c1bb3127cf5c86373ff5820954d6bba2545a548" :answer/id #uuid "e4a1c459-0312-589c-8494-1d5f96a3b282" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "358\\,800" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-84987/selection/1b8012bcc9b9eff52baaebf9b0d987e12979a64e90d0a148db8f66d52037219c" :answer/id #uuid "5242bbb8-44fc-568e-8ae8-a18d39d935d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "57\\,120" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-84987/selection/70e67